---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import SocialLinks from '../components/SocialLinks.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Aditya Vinod Kumar" description="Profile Page" canonicalPath="/" currentPage="home" bodyClass="home-page">
<div class="container hero">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <h1 class="display-2">Aditya VK</h1>
                <h4 class="hero-intro">You can call me Adi. Here is a look into what I do, think and feel. </h4>
                <SocialLinks />
            </div>
            <img class="profile-image" src="/assets/noir_profile.png" alt="profile picture" width="225" height="350">
        </div>
        <div class="container biography">
            <p>I am currently pursuing a Masters of Science in Computer Science at New York University - Courant
                Institute of Mathematical Sciences.</p>
            <p>I love to build scalable products with technology.
                I characterize myself as having a knack for product thinking with a passion for engineering.</p>
            <p>I love devising new and extrapolating existing strategies for solving problems within any
                convention of problem solving. In Computer Science, I derive this joy using algorithms.
                Some of my most memorable experiences with CS have come from figuring out a new algorithm
                or data structure to solve a problem. I am also extremely passionate about Distributed Systems,
                Machine Learning and large Software Architectures.</p>
            <p>I have professional experience working with several technologies such as
                Full-Stack Development, Cloud Computing, and Machine Learning. I have also worked
                on several projects involving Deep Learning and Reinforcement Learning. I constantly
                spend time learning about these topics.</p>
            <p>I am a tech-optimist and love to keep up with all the trends in our burgeoning generation.</p>
            <p>I love reading and learning more about history, life sciences and the path forward for our
                generation.
                I am very interested in world affairs, foreign policy and current market trends.
                I read newsletters everyday on these topics.</p>
            <p>I am an avid conversationalist. I love to talk, connect with people, hear everybody's stories and
                add more to their life. My close friends have added more to my life than I could have asked for.</p>
            <p>I am a public speaker with a knack for debating and love to voice my opinions
                and be heard.</p>
            <p>I am a fitness freak, constantly working towards pushing my limits on strength and endurance.
                I love to play tennis and consider myself an ardent fan.</p>
            <p>I love to VLOG and do Acts, aspiring to become a content creator. The video medium
                for sharing stories is a beautiful format that I believe enriches our lives.</p>
            <h4 class="closing-thought">I am all about the Flow - any concluded sensible thought from start to end. </h4>
            <!--<h3>Subscribe to my Youtube Channel for the most entertaining travel, cuisine-->
                <!--vlogs and comedic acts!</h3>-->
        </div>
</SiteLayout>
